//! id:        fn_pure_inhand_decide_ok
//! section:   04_functions
//! expect:    accept
//! spec:      §4, §13 (a rule-driven `decide` over an in-hand Credence is a pure collapse, no dependency reach → pure-permitted)
//! note:      a pure fn may rule-decide a Credence value already in hand.
//! ---
pure Decision<bool> over(Credence<bool> c) { return decide c by confidence 0.9; }
